# The crash cases on the device: phone-shell runs as a systemd service with an
# fd store of four places (phone-fdstore-check.service, which selftest-boot.sh
# starts), crashes on purpose, and the instance systemd restarts takes the
# apps over from LISTEN_FDS.

sleep 800

== Shell 崩溃：systemd 从 fd 存储把应用连接交给重启的 Shell，应用不重启
require-fdstore
at sys.idle 8000
key f4
type /
type 计算器
key enter
wait 小数点
# Three digits: `wait` sees the whole screen, and the status bar's clock
# can show any two.
type 587
wait 587
app-pid com.phone.calc save
shell-crash
at sys.idle 15000
app-pid com.phone.calc same
adopted com.phone.calc
key f4
type /
type 计算器
key enter
wait 587
key f4

== Shell 崩溃后应用仍在它自己的 systemd 作用域里，限额照旧，冻结照常
require-cgroup
cgroup com.phone.calc memory.max 201326592
cgroup com.phone.calc pids.max 128
freeze-after 500
key f4
appstate com.phone.calc frozen 5000
cgroup com.phone.calc cgroup.freeze 1
freeze-after 0

== 应用自己的长连接，fd 存储的位置不够时：存储只有 4 个位置，应用自己的连接最多占 1 个（测试服务器在 Shell 的服务之外，崩溃后还在）；「长连接示例」连上后它的连接在存储里，「保活 WebSocket 示例」再连上，最近用过的后者占了这个位置、前者的挤出去（只在 Shell 手里）；后者停掉，前者的回到存储；后者再连上又把它挤出去；Shell 崩溃，systemd 重启的 Shell 接管两个应用和后者的连接，告诉前者「没有位置（full）」，前者重新连上，这回它最近用过、占了位置；最后卸载
require-fdstore
require-cgroup
require-example keepalive
require-example keepalive-ts
appstop com.phone.calc
key f4
setting developer_mode 1
at sys.idle
freeze-after -1
keep-server 127.0.0.1:0 outside
pkg-install keepalive
pkg-install keepalive-ts
type /
type 长连接示例
key enter
at com.example.keepalive/main 10000
fill {keepalive}
key enter
wait 已连上 127.0.0.1 10000
keep-got 1 HELLO
fdstore com.example.keepalive keep yes
key f4
at sys.idle
type /
type 保活 WebSocket 示例
key enter
at com.example.keepalivets/main 10000
fill ws://{keepalive}/live
key enter
wait 已连上 ws://127.0.0.1 10000
keep-got 2 HELLO
fdstore com.example.keepalivets keep yes
fdstore com.example.keepalive keep no
shell-log keepalive: no room for com.example.keepalive's connection in the fd store (4 places
fdstore com.example.keepalive app yes
fdstore com.example.keepalivets app yes
key f4
at sys.idle
appstop com.example.keepalivets
fdstore com.example.keepalive keep yes
shell-log keepalive: com.example.keepalive's connection has a place in the fd store again
type /
type 保活 WebSocket 示例
key enter
at com.example.keepalivets/main 10000
fill ws://{keepalive}/live
key enter
wait 已连上 ws://127.0.0.1 10000
keep-got 3 HELLO
fdstore com.example.keepalivets keep yes
fdstore com.example.keepalive keep no
key f4
at sys.idle
app-pid com.example.keepalive save
app-pid com.example.keepalivets save
shell-crash
at sys.idle 15000
freeze-after -1
app-pid com.example.keepalive same
app-pid com.example.keepalivets same
adopted com.example.keepalive
adopted com.example.keepalivets
shell-log keepalive: com.example.keepalive's connection had no room in the fd store; told the app to connect again (full)
app-log com.example.keepalive com.example.keepalive: keepalive lost (full): connecting again
keep-got 4 HELLO
fdstore com.example.keepalive keep yes
fdstore com.example.keepalivets keep no
fdstore com.example.keepalivets app yes
appstop com.example.keepalive
appstop com.example.keepalivets
pkg-uninstall com.example.keepalive
pkg-uninstall com.example.keepalivets
keep-server off
freeze-after 0
setting developer_mode 0

== 应用自己的长连接在 Shell 崩溃前被服务器断开：「长连接示例」在前台，自己读到断开；Shell 那份只在应用冻结时才看，没察觉；systemd 发现存储里那份挂断了，把它扔掉；Shell 崩溃，systemd 重启的 Shell 接管应用，发现它的连接没跟过来，告诉它「丢了（dropped）」；最后卸载
require-fdstore
require-cgroup
require-example keepalive
key f4
setting developer_mode 1
at sys.idle
freeze-after -1
keep-server 127.0.0.1:0 outside
pkg-install keepalive
type /
type 长连接示例
key enter
at com.example.keepalive/main 10000
fill {keepalive}
key enter
wait 已连上 127.0.0.1 10000
keep-got 1 HELLO
fdstore com.example.keepalive keep yes
keep-reset
app-log com.example.keepalive com.example.keepalive: keepalive closed: the server closed it
wait 没有连接
fdstore com.example.keepalive keep no
app-pid com.example.keepalive save
shell-crash
at sys.idle 15000
freeze-after -1
app-pid com.example.keepalive same
adopted com.example.keepalive
shell-log keepalive: com.example.keepalive's connection did not come along; told the app to connect again (dropped)
appstop com.example.keepalive
pkg-uninstall com.example.keepalive
keep-server off
freeze-after 0
setting developer_mode 0
